WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.195
Jemima hiked up a big hill.

2
00:00:11.196 --> 00:00:14.701
From the top she saw a forest.

3
00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:18.794
It was very far away.

4
00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:25.005
"I'll lay my eggs there," she said.

5
00:00:25.006 --> 00:00:31.249
Jemima ran and flapped her wings.

6
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.412
Up, up, up she went.

7
00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:38.553
Jemima flew through the air.

8
00:00:38.554 --> 00:00:43.737
Soon she was flying over the forest.

9
00:00:43.738 --> 00:00:49.855
She saw a nice spot and landed.

10
00:00:49.856 --> 00:00:54.972
Jemima took a few steps and stopped.

11
00:00:54.973 --> 00:00:59.097
A stranger sat on a tree stump.

12
00:00:59.098 --> 00:01:03.296
He wore fancy clothes.

13
00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:07.307
Jemima didn't know that he was a fox!

14
00:01:07.308 --> 00:01:10.565
The fox looked up from his newspaper.

15
00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:15.018
He smiled.

16
00:01:15.019 --> 00:01:19.042
"Hello," said the fox.

17
00:01:19.043 --> 00:01:22.741
"Are you lost?"

18
00:01:22.742 --> 00:01:27.853
"What a nice gentleman," thought Jemima.

19
00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:32.074
"No, I'm not lost," she said.

20
00:01:32.075 --> 00:01:35.413
"I need a place to lay my eggs."

21
00:01:35.414 --> 00:01:38.444
The fox grinned.

22
00:01:38.445 --> 00:01:43.178
"I love eggs!" he said.

23
00:01:43.179 --> 00:01:47.443
"And I love little ducklings!"

24
00:01:47.444 --> 00:01:50.624
"Oh?" said Jemima.

25
00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:54.567
"Come with me, dear," said the fox.

26
00:01:54.568 --> 00:01:58.129
His teeth sparkled in the sun.

27
00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.534
"You can lay your eggs in my shed.

28
00:02:01.535 --> 00:02:10.525
They will be very safe there."

